{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t獨立委員會的報告指出，房屋局的獨立審查組、屋宇署、消防處及勞工處都有缺失或者不足，應為火災負上部分責任。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n行政長官李家超宣布，啟動行政責任兩級調查機制，要求公務員敍用委員會在三個月內完成調查，並就政府應考慮採取的紀律行動及行政處分提出建議。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:01:37.860162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:41:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:39:18.352899+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:58:41.436392+00:00","content_hash":"a0a9e3e66b5843a35eef344d5c8122d4d76d85c988664718428acf6be6e6615b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}